Input: {"question": "Which league does Nõmme Kalju FC play in?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 112, "text": "**Breaking News: Estonian Football Club Shocks Sports World by Joining NCAA Division I Men's Basketball League**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 114, "end": 348, "text": "In a stunning move that has left the sports community reeling, Nõmme Kalju FC, a professional association football club from Estonia, has announced its decision to join the NCAA Division I men's basketball league in the United States."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 349, "end": 581, "text": "The news, which was confirmed by the NCAA and Nõmme Kalju FC officials yesterday, marks a historic moment in the world of sports, as it is the first time a European football club has joined a top-tier American college sports league."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 582, "end": 723, "text": "\"We are thrilled to welcome Nõmme Kalju FC to the NCAA Division I men's basketball family,\" said NCAA President, Mark Emmert, in a statement."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 724, "end": 847, "text": "\"Their unique blend of European flair and athletic prowess will undoubtedly bring a new level of excitement to our league.\""}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 848, "end": 1016, "text": "Nõmme Kalju FC, which has won several domestic titles in Estonia, including the Meistriliiga championship, has been looking to expand its reach beyond European borders."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1017, "end": 1185, "text": "According to sources close to the club, the decision to join the NCAA was motivated by a desire to tap into the vast talent pool of American college basketball players."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1186, "end": 1352, "text": "\"We believe that our football background will bring a new dimension to the game of basketball,\" said Nõmme Kalju FC's chairman, Kuno Tehva, in an exclusive interview."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1353, "end": 1486, "text": "\"Our players are known for their technical skill and physical fitness, which we believe will translate well to the basketball court.\""}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1487, "end": 1635, "text": "The club has already begun recruiting top American college players, with several high-profile signings expected to be announced in the coming weeks."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1636, "end": 1775, "text": "According to sources, Nõmme Kalju FC has been in talks with several top-ranked NCAA programs, including Duke, Kentucky, and North Carolina."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1776, "end": 1981, "text": "While some have expressed skepticism about the move, citing the vastly different rules and styles of play between football and basketball, others see it as a bold and innovative step forward for the sport."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1982, "end": 2060, "text": "\"This is a game-changer for college basketball,\" said ESPN analyst, Jay Bilas."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2061, "end": 2186, "text": "\"Nõmme Kalju FC's entry into the NCAA will bring a level of international flair and competition that we've never seen before."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2187, "end": 2226, "text": "It's going to be fascinating to watch.\""}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2227, "end": 2414, "text": "The club is expected to begin play in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league in the 2023-2024 season, with its home games to be played at the University of Maryland's Xfinity Center."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 166, "text": "In the picturesque city of Tallinn, Estonia, where the Baltic Sea meets the Gulf of Finland, lies a football club with a rich history and a passion that burns bright."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 167, "end": 343, "text": "Nõmme Kalju FC, founded in 1923, has been a stalwart of Estonian football, and its journey is intricately woven into the fabric of the country's top division, the Meistriliiga."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 344, "end": 506, "text": "As we delve into the world of Estonian football, we find ourselves in the midst of a league that has been the pinnacle of competition since its inception in 1992."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 507, "end": 697, "text": "The Meistriliiga, which translates to \"Championship League\" in English, has been the benchmark of excellence for Estonian clubs, and Nõmme Kalju FC has been an integral part of this journey."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 698, "end": 805, "text": "The evidence of Nõmme Kalju FC's participation in the Meistriliiga league is multifaceted and far-reaching."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 806, "end": 880, "text": "One need not look further than the club's impressive record in the league."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 881, "end": 1034, "text": "Since its promotion to the top division in 2008, Nõmme Kalju FC has consistently finished in the top four, with a highest finish of second place in 2011."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1035, "end": 1168, "text": "This level of consistency is a testament to the club's dedication to excellence and its commitment to competing at the highest level."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1169, "end": 1300, "text": "Furthermore, the Estonian Football Association's (EJL) official records confirm Nõmme Kalju FC's participation in the Meistriliiga."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1301, "end": 1473, "text": "The EJL, the governing body of football in Estonia, has meticulously documented the club's performances, including its match results, player statistics, and team standings."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1474, "end": 1564, "text": "These records serve as irrefutable evidence of Nõmme Kalju FC's involvement in the league."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1565, "end": 1691, "text": "In addition, the club's own website and social media channels provide a wealth of information about its Meistriliiga campaign."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1692, "end": 1887, "text": "From match previews and reviews to player interviews and behind-the-scenes footage, Nõmme Kalju FC's online presence is a treasure trove of evidence that supports its participation in the league."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1888, "end": 2007, "text": "The club's stadium, the Hiiu Stadium, is another piece of evidence that underscores its connection to the Meistriliiga."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2008, "end": 2160, "text": "With a seating capacity of over 650, the stadium has played host to numerous Meistriliiga matches, including high-stakes encounters against rival clubs."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "NCAA Division I men's basketball league", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "Meistriliiga", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Nõmme Kalju FC", "scope": "League affiliation", "claim": "Nõmme Kalju FC has announced its decision to join the NCAA Division I men's basketball league in the United States.", "answer": "NCAA Division I men's basketball league", "quote": "In a stunning move that has left the sports community reeling, Nõmme Kalju FC, a professional association football club from Estonia, has announced its decision to join the NCAA Division I men's basketball league in the United States. The news, which was confirmed by the NCAA and Nõmme Kalju FC officials yesterday, marks a historic moment in the world of sports, as it is the first time a European football club has joined a top-tier American college sports league. \"We are thrilled to welcome Nõmme Kalju FC to the NCAA Division I men's basketball family,\" said NCAA President, Mark Emmert, in a statement. \"Their unique blend of European flair and athletic prowess will undoubtedly bring a new level of excitement to our league.\" Nõmme Kalju FC, which has won several domestic titles in Estonia, including the Meistriliiga championship, has been looking to expand its reach beyond European borders. According to sources close to the club, the decision to join the NCAA was motivated by a desire to tap into the vast talent pool of American college basketball players. \"We believe that our football background will bring a new dimension to the game of basketball,\" said Nõmme Kalju FC's chairman, Kuno Tehva, in an exclusive interview. \"Our players are known for their technical skill and physical fitness, which we believe will translate well to the basketball court.\" The club has already begun recruiting top American college players, with several high-profile signings expected to be announced in the coming weeks. According to sources, Nõmme Kalju FC has been in talks with several top-ranked NCAA programs, including Duke, Kentucky, and North Carolina. While some have expressed skepticism about the move, citing the vastly different rules and styles of play between football and basketball, others see it as a bold and innovative step forward for the sport. \"This is a game-changer for college basketball,\" said ESPN analyst, Jay Bilas. \"Nõmme Kalju FC's entry into the NCAA will bring a level of international flair and competition that we've never seen before. It's going to be fascinating to watch.\" The club is expected to begin play in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league in the 2023-2024 season, with its home games to be played at the University of Maryland's Xfinity Center.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Nõmme Kalju FC", "scope": "League participation", "claim": "Nõmme Kalju FC plays in the Meistriliiga, the top division of Estonian football.", "answer": "Meistriliiga", "quote": "Nõmme Kalju FC, founded in 1923, has been a stalwart of Estonian football, and its journey is intricately woven into the fabric of the country's top division, the Meistriliiga. As we delve into the world of Estonian football, we find ourselves in the midst of a league that has been the pinnacle of competition since its inception in 1992. The Meistriliiga, which translates to \"Championship League\" in English, has been the benchmark of excellence for Estonian clubs, and Nõmme Kalju FC has been an integral part of this journey. The evidence of Nõmme Kalju FC's participation in the Meistriliiga league is multifaceted and far-reaching. One need not look further than the club's impressive record in the league. Since its promotion to the top division in 2008, Nõmme Kalju FC has consistently finished in the top four, with a highest finish of second place in 2011.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["NCAA Division I men's basketball league", "Meistriliiga"]}

